{"sections":[{"slug":"淡中对偶","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"淡中对偶"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">淡中对偶</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"淡中对偶"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当几何对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数侧对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是一个带有代数结构的范畴时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个几何对象的基点体现为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">而纤维函子的自同构可理解为该几何对象的基本群</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">这就是淡中构造</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半线性范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定代数闭域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为基域</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">淡中范畴</span></strong> (Tannakian category) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧生成范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧生成</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span>"}},{"Plain":" $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\operatorname{End}(1)\\simeq k$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么仿射群概形</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">的分类叠</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">对偶于淡中范畴</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于仿射群概形</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类叠</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X = * / G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{QCoh}(X) = \\mathsf{Rep}(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为淡中范畴</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于淡中范畴</span> $(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)$, <span lang=\"zh\">叠</span> $A \\mapsto \\mathsf{Fun}^{\\otimes, \\mathrm{colim}} (\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Mod}(A))$ <span lang=\"zh\">为某代数群的分类叠</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其对应一个</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}A$; <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴为</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Mod}(A) := [\\mathbf{B}A, \\mathcal V].\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实函子</span> $\\mathbf{B}A\\to\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">取值于</span> $\\mathbf{B}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的唯一对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">给出遗忘函子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即所谓</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span></strong>)\n$$\r\nF \\colon \\mathsf{Mod}(A)\\to\\mathcal V.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">由函子</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">可重构出代数</span> $A$:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{End}(F) \\simeq A.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/佐武等价","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">佐武</span> (Satake) <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}